# MiniMax H3 prompt presets — one env file for this entire prompt category
H3_PRESET_FAMILY="global_visual_style"
H3_PRESETS_JSON={"Anime Cel":"Clean anime cel animation, decisive outlines, controlled cel shadows, expressive poses, vivid color design and stable character proportions.","Architectural Cinema":"Architectural cinematography, disciplined perspective, strong leading lines, measured camera travel, material detail and controlled human scale.","Beauty Campaign":"Beauty-campaign cinematography, flattering soft key light, accurate skin texture, elegant hair movement, refined color and clean facial detail.","Blue Hour":"Blue-hour ambience, cool environmental light, warm practical accents, soft silhouettes, subtle haze and calm cinematic contrast.","Bold Comic Ink":"Bold comic-book ink style, heavy linework, limited high-contrast palette, halftone texture, graphic speed lines and expressive panel composition.","Claymation":"Handmade claymation style, tactile fingerprints, miniature sets, soft studio lighting, stepped stop-motion timing and charming material deformation.","Clean Corporate":"Modern corporate visual language, neutral balanced color, bright practical environments, composed camera movement and approachable professional performances.","Dark Fantasy":"Dark-fantasy cinema, ancient tactile environments, cold shadowed palette, motivated firelight, atmospheric particles and grounded dramatic movement.","Dreamlike Surreal":"Dreamlike surreal realism, familiar subjects in subtly impossible space, soft atmospheric light, elegant visual metaphor and continuous believable motion.","Food Commercial":"Premium food-commercial macro realism, appetizing color, precise surface highlights, controlled steam and droplets, tactile motion and immaculate styling.","Golden Hour":"Warm golden-hour sunlight, long soft shadows, luminous skin, gentle lens bloom, amber highlights and natural atmospheric depth.","Hand-Drawn Pencil":"Hand-drawn pencil animation, visible graphite texture, loose construction lines, paper grain, restrained shading and expressive frame-to-frame motion.","High-Key Studio":"High-key studio look, bright seamless background, soft wraparound illumination, low shadow density, clean color and catalogue-level clarity.","Low-Key Noir":"Low-key noir cinematography, hard motivated light, deep shadows, selective highlights, smoky depth and restrained monochromatic color.","Luxury Product Cinema":"Luxury product cinematography, precise highlights, deep controlled shadows, premium materials, slow deliberate motion and immaculate visual separation.","Minimalist Product":"Minimalist product-ad style, uncluttered negative space, precise geometry, soft premium lighting, restrained palette and slow intentional motion.","Natural Lifestyle":"Natural lifestyle realism, available daylight, relaxed performances, tactile environments, gentle handheld presence and authentic imperfections.","Neon Cyberpunk":"Neon cyberpunk city style, saturated magenta and cyan lighting, wet reflections, deep contrast, atmospheric haze and futuristic production design.","Oil Painting":"Painterly oil-on-canvas style, visible brushwork, rich color layering, dramatic modeled light and coherent moving painted forms.","Papercraft":"Layered papercraft aesthetic, cut-paper edges, folded shapes, shallow diorama depth, tactile shadows and deliberate stop-motion movement.","Performance Music Video":"Performance-driven music-video style, rhythmic camera blocking, expressive lighting, bold composition, precise beat emphasis and strong visual continuity.","Photorealistic Commercial":"Photorealistic commercial cinematography, clean exposure, realistic materials, controlled contrast, natural skin texture and polished production lighting.","Premium Fashion Editorial":"Premium fashion-editorial imagery, refined wardrobe texture, elegant posing, directional soft light, restrained color grading and confident composition.","Retro 1980s":"1980s commercial style, bold color blocks, glossy highlights, soft diffusion, practical neon, subtle analog grain and energetic framing.","Retro 1990s":"1990s editorial realism, direct flash accents, slightly muted print color, candid attitude, textured grain and simple graphic composition.","Sci-Fi Industrial":"Industrial science-fiction style, functional machinery, metallic surfaces, volumetric utility light, cool restrained color and realistic mechanical motion.","Sports Fashion Campaign":"High-energy sports-fashion campaign, crisp daylight, athletic movement, clean saturated color, realistic fabric physics and stabilized full-body framing.","Stylized 3D Animation":"Stylized 3D animation, clean modeled forms, soft global illumination, readable silhouettes, polished materials and physically coherent motion.","Vintage Film":"Vintage photochemical film look, organic grain, gentle halation, softened contrast, period color response, subtle gate weave and cinematic exposure.","Warm Family":"Warm family-commercial style, gentle natural light, welcoming color, sincere expressions, soft camera movement and comfortable lived-in environments.","Watercolor":"Expressive watercolor animation, translucent pigment washes, textured paper, soft edge blooms, restrained linework and fluid atmospheric transitions.","Y2K Pop":"Y2K pop aesthetic, chrome accents, glossy pastel color, bright frontal lighting, playful confidence and polished music-video energy."}
